1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:03,025
(Leonard:)There's no such thing
as haircut records.

2
00:00:03,568 --> 00:00:07,108
- Yes, there are.
- Have you ever seen them?

3
00:00:07,322 --> 00:00:09,742
(Sheldon:)No, but my mother assured me
they were sent here...

4
00:00:09,949 --> 00:00:13,619
...and I'll bet you dollars to donuts
that this one doesn't have them.

5
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:14,958
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

6
00:00:15,163 --> 00:00:17,503
(Sheldon:)Do you have access
to my haircut records?

7
00:00:17,707 --> 00:00:19,087
(Barber:)Your what?

8
00:00:19,626 --> 00:00:22,376
(Sheldon:)To paraphrase T.S. Eliot,
this is the way the world ends.

9
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:25,677
(Sheldon:)Not with a bang but with a nephew.

10
00:00:27,217 --> 00:00:29,637
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you're a grown man,
he's a professional...

11
00:00:29,844 --> 00:00:33,644
(Leonard:)...and your haircut is number three
on that poster from 1946.

12
00:00:34,474 --> 00:00:37,104
(Leonard:)- Just sit down and let him do it.
- Fine.

13
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:40,900
(Sheldon:)But if I come out of this
looking like a dork, it's on you.

14
00:00:49,114 --> 00:00:51,404
- So my kid said the funniest thing today.
- Nope.

15
00:00:56,955 --> 00:01:02,025
(Leonard:)When you tell this story later,
the word we usually use is "quirky."

